    "title": "\"Forgive Me, Father\" || William Lombardy vs Bobby Fischer || United States Championship (1960/61)",
    "description": "https://vastknowledge.org/\n\nDownload Lotus Chess Here! https://onelink.to/lotus-agadmator \nhttps://tournament.lotus-chess.com/tournaments\nSearch all my videos easy https://agadmator-library.github.io/\n\nWilliam Lombardy vs Bobby Fischer\n\"Forgive Me, Father\" (game of the day Jul-27-2012)\nUnited States Championship (1960/61), New York, NY USA, rd 2, Dec-19\nSicilian Defense: Prins Variation (B54)\n\n1. e4 c5 2. Nf3 d6 3. d4 cd4 4. Nd4 Nf6 5. f3 Nc6 6. c4 e6 7. Nc3 Be7 8. Be3 O-O 9. Nc2 d5 10. cd5 ed5 11. Nd5 Nd5 12. Qd5 Qc7 13. Qb5 Bd7 14. Rc1 Nb4 15. Nb4 Qc1 16. Bc1 Bb5 17. Nd5 Bh4 18. g3 Bf1 19. Rf1 Bd8 20. Bd2 Rc8 21. Bc3 f5 22. e5 Rc5 23. Nb4 Ba5 24. a3 Bb4 25. ab4 Rd5 26. Ke2 Kf7 27. h4 Ke6 28. Ke3 Rc8 29. Rg1 Rc4 30. Re1 Rc3 31. bc3 Re5 32. Kd2 Re1 33. Ke1 Kd5 34. Kd2 Kc4 35. h5 b6 36. Kc2 g5 37. h6 f4 38. g4 a5 39. ba5 ba5 40. Kb2 a4 41. Ka3 Kc3 42. Ka4 Kd4 43. Kb4 Ke3\n\n0:01 Hello Everyone!\n\nCheck out agadmator's merch here https://teespring.com/stores/agadmators-swag-store\nhttps://teespring.com/design-with-a-story-tm\n\nMailbox where you can send stuff:\n\nAntonio Radić\nAGADMATOR d.o.o.\nFranje Tuđmana 12\nCroatia\n48260 Križevci \np.s. this is not my home address :)\n\nContact me: agadmator@gmail.com \n\nVideo created by OBS\n\n----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nIf you realllly enjoy my content, you're welcome to support me and my channel with a small donation via PayPal or Crypto.\n\nLink to PayPal donation https://www.paypal.me/agadmator\n\nBTC address bc1qckd3ut0hqyymzv33eus97ld8klj02xhk2kcwld\n\nFor any other currency address, contact me via agadmator@gmail.com\n\nCheck out some of the books I enjoy https://www.amazon.com/ideas/amzn1.account.AFWWCIBWCL5PGEPL73FDWK632F7Q/2QAGBMLVXE7MG\n\nCheck out ALL my videos here https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fYgd5ZLdHz8&list=PLDnx7w_xuguFTxcfiM11bB1JchtHclEJg\n\nFacebook: https://w